ount (CC 27, LSB 59); Amp EG Attack (CC 28, LSB 60); Amp EG Decay (CC 29, LSB 61); Amp EG Sustain (CC 30, LSB 62); Amp EG Release (CC 31, LSB 63).","A number, not a choice, where its bands are printed out of order (0-42, 3-85, 86-127): Wave Mod Destination (CC 72).","A number, not a choice, where its bands are printed out of order (0-31, 32-64, 64-95, 96-127): Note Priority (CC 111)."],"coverage":{"singleParameterWrite":"complete-for-the-manual's-midi-tables","realtimeEditing":"complete-for-the-manual's-midi-tables","editBufferDumpRequest":"notImplemented","editBufferDumpParse":"notImplemented","bankDump":"notImplemented","inboundControllers":"the panel sends these same messages when its MIDI settings allow","verifiedOnHardware":false},"timing":{"minDelayBetweenMessagesMs":0},"tests":[{"name":"Mod Wheel = 1000 (CC 1)","parameter":"modulation.modWheel","value":1000,"expectedHex":"B0 01 07\nB0 21 68"},{"name":"Wave Mod Destination = 100 (CC 72)","parameter":"oscillators.waveModDestination","value":100,"expectedHex":"B0 48 64"},{"name":"Glide Enable = ON (CC 65)","parameter":"glide.glideEnable","value":"on","expectedHex":"B0 41 40"},{"name":"KB Transpose (Semitones) = 24 (CC 119)","parameter":"keyboard.kbTransposeSemitones","value":24,"expectedHex":"B0 77 18"}]}}
